SatSplat
Copyright 2026 the SatSplat authors

The SatSplat research code builds on EOGS (Luca Savant Aira, Gabriele
Facciolo, and Thibaud Ehret) and uses the open-source gsplat library.
The affine 2DGS rasterizer is supplied by GDAOSU/gsplat, installed separately.
Benchmark imagery and reference rasters retain their original terms.
